LumioSample block texture pack (Client/Assets/Blocks)

Scope: every PNG under textures/ and preview/, every lumio.*.json block asset
description and pack.json in this directory, and the generator
source/generate-textures.mjs.

These files were created from scratch by the LumioSample contributors. The
textures are drawn procedurally by source/generate-textures.mjs; no external
image, texture pack, or Minecraft / Mojang asset was used, traced, or referenced.

To the extent possible under law, the LumioSample contributors have waived all
copyright and related or neighboring rights to these files by dedicating them
to the public domain under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain
Dedication (SPDX: CC0-1.0).

Full legal code: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

The rest of the LumioSample repository is licensed separately (see the LICENSE
file at the repository root).

If a texture from another source is added later, its source, version, author
and license are recorded per file in SOURCES.md, and CC-BY-4.0 textures are
credited in ATTRIBUTION.md. Only CC0-1.0 and CC-BY-4.0 are accepted.
